WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.520
Drop a phone. How fast is it falling?

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:09.240
After t seconds it has fallen 4.9 t squared metres.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:13.310
Average speed is the slope of a line joining two points.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:21.013
Slide the two points together, and that line becomes the tangent: the speed at one instant.
